                                "sense_id": "49944df7-6ec4-30e7-91c8-d278071ee11c",
                                "text": "When the school year finished, he put all of his stationery away in the loft, as he would have no need for pencils and exercise books during the holidays."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a7c61f1-4d22-41d7-91a9-8434eb3589dc",
                                "sense_id": "49944df7-6ec4-30e7-91c8-d278071ee11c",
                                "text": "We can pick up more paper and pens at the stationery store."
                            }
                        ]
